description=Universal Zygisk anti-detection: hides root frameworks (Magisk/KernelSU/APatch), Zygisk, LSPosed/Xposed/Riru, Frida, Shamiko, busybox, Play Integrity Fix; spoofs device props, kernel, /proc, SELinux, mounts, maps, environ, net sockets; blocks ptrace, inotify, connect to daemon sockets. Compatible with Zygisk Next and ReZygisk. Targets Native Detector, Ruru, Momo and all standard root checkers.
